<section class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="about-content">
            <div class="about-text">
                <h2>Your Trusted Car Rental Partner</h2>
                <p>At RentCar, we believe that renting a car should be simple, affordable, and hassle-free. Our mission is to provide the best car rental experience to our customers by offering quality vehicles, competitive prices, and exceptional service.</p>
                <p>Founded in 2020, we have grown from a small local business to a trusted car rental provider serving thousands of satisfied customers. Our fleet includes a wide range of vehicles from economy cars to luxury SUVs, ensuring that we have the perfect car for every need and budget.</p>
                <p>We pride ourselves on our commitment to customer satisfaction, transparency, and reliability. Whether you're traveling for business, planning a family vacation, or need a temporary vehicle, we're here to make your journey better.</p>
                
                <div class="about-mission">
                    <div class="mission-item">
                        <i class="fas fa-eye"></i>
                        <div>
                            <h4>Our Vision</h4>
                            <p>To become the most trusted and preferred car rental service, known for excellence and innovation.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mission-item">
                        <i class="fas fa-bullseye"></i>
                        <div>
                            <h4>Our Mission</h4>
                            <p>To provide reliable, affordable, and convenient car rental solutions that exceed customer expectations.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mission-item">
                        <i class="fas fa-heart"></i>
                        <div>
                            <h4>Our Values</h4>
                            <p>Customer first, integrity, excellence, innovation, and sustainability in everything we do.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="about-image">
                <img src="/images/about-car.jpg" alt="About RentCar" onerror="this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/600x400/2563eb/ffffff?text=RentCar'">
